        <mxCell id="foot" value="Footnote: Halden Distribution Ltd. is a fictional company. This diagram is a design, not measured evidence; no scan has been run and no figure here is a result. The bundled sample data used by the interactive demo is synthetic, and the scanner is scoped to the isolated lab ranges only. Model inspired by the risk-tier concept in CISA BOD 26-04 (June 2026); an independent adaptation, not a claim of compliance." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#64748b;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
